 "lines": [
  "I'm twenty-two. And I'm an introvert.",
  "So I built my business around that.",
  "Most business advice I saw said the same thing.",
  "Cold call. DM strangers. Get on sales calls.",
  "That's the exact stuff I wanted to avoid.",
  "So I flipped it.",
  "Instead of chasing customers,",
  "I build a small site that homeowners find on Google.",
  "They ask for a quote.",
  "I pass it to a local contractor.",
  "He pays ten percent, only if he closes the job.",
  "Real talk.",
  "I still talk to contractors. It's not zero people.",
  "And it's slow. Ranking takes months.",
  "But it's work I can actually keep doing.",
  "Follow. Ep. twelve: rank and rent versus an SEO agency."
